 "raw_html": "<body><div class=\"eltdf-grid eltdf-ls-content-area\">\n<div class=\"rehabIntro\">\n<div class=\"rehabContent\">\n<div class=\"excerptData\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-content\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-content-inner\">\n<h3><strong>About</strong> Sir Sanford Fleming House</h3>\n<p>Sir Sanford Fleming House is a Non-Profit rehab located in Halifax, Nova Scotia. Sir Sanford Fleming House specializes in the treatment of substance, drug and alcohol abuse.</p>\n<div class=\"specialAmenities\">\n<div class=\"specialties\">\n<h4>Specialties</h4>\n<p>12 Step Programs,Substance Abuse Treatmental</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"allamenities\">\n<h4>Amenities</h4>\n<p>12 Step Programs,Substance Abuse Treatmental</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4>Therapies</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Holistic Therapy</li>\n<li>Evidence-Based Practices</li>\n<li>Yoga &amp; Meditation</li>\n<li>Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Family Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Group Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Nutritional Counseling</li>\n<li>Art &amp; Nature Therapy</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"rehabContacts\">\n<div class=\"rehabContactsSidebar\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-contact-info\">\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-cid-holder\">\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-phone\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_mobile\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-phone-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:(902) 423-1219\" itemprop=\"url\">(902) 423-1219</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-email\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_mail\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-email-link\" href=\"mailto:info@shelternovascotia.com\" itemprop=\"url\">info@shelternovascotia.com</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-site-url\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_globe-2\"></span> <a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-site-url-link\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"https://www.shelternovascotia.com/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.shelternovascotia.com/</a>\n</p>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-location-address\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"eltdf-icon-font-elegant icon_house\"></span>\t                    2549 Brunswick St, Halifax, NS B3K 2Z5, Canada\t                </p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"eltdf-btn eltdf-btn-huge eltdf-btn-solid eltdf-btn-icon eltdf-enquiry-opener\" type=\"submit\"> <span class=\"eltdf-btn-text\">Contact Business</span> <i class=\"eltdf-icon-ion-icon icon ion-android-person\"></i> </button>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social\">\n<h5 class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social-title\">Social</h5>\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social-facebook\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ShelterNovaScotia\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n</a>\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-location-social-twitter\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/ShelterNS\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"></i>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> <div class=\"eltdf-ls-ads\">\n<h4 class=\"eltdf-ls-parts-title\">Sponsored Ad</h4>\n<div class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-info\">\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:1-855-885-4747\" itemprop=\"url\"><img alt=\"addiction rehab centres\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px\" src=\"https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.jpg 970w, https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1-300x285.jpg 300w, https://addictionrehabcenters.ca/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1-768x728.jpg 768w\" width=\"970\"/></a> <h2 class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-title\">\n<a class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-link\" data-wpel-link=\"internal\" href=\"tel:1-855-885-4747\" itemprop=\"url\">Start Your Journey Now</a> </h2>\n<p class=\"eltdf-ls-ads-text\">Are you or a loved one struggling with alcohol or drug addiction? Finding the right addiction treatment centre can make all the difference in achieving long-term recovery. That's why we've done the research for you and compiled a list of the best alcohol and drug addiction centres in Canada.\nOur list includes top-rated addiction treatment centres that provide evidence-based therapies, personalized treatment plans, and aftercare support services to help clients overcome addiction and maintain a healthy, fulfilling life in recovery. Whether you're looking for residential or outpatient treatment, we've got you covered.\n\nFor immediate treatment help call: 1-855-885-4747</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></body>"
